.git
.gitignore
README.md
data/
*.json
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# macOS metadata sidecars. deploy.sh already stops its tar from making them,
# but ones shipped before it did are still sitting on the NAS, and COPY would
# otherwise bake them into the image. Both forms: a .dockerignore pattern is
# matched against the whole path from the context root, so a bare ._* would
# catch the ones beside the Dockerfile and miss web/._index.html.
._*
**/._*
